      ":question/id": "a7b58667-7daa-5bdf-bd7d-dbff1628cc1d",
      ":question/problem": "What is $\\frac{4}{3}(\\frac{v}{4})^{2}(\\frac{3}{u})^{2}$?",
      ":question/worked-solution": "We apply the power of quotient rule and simplify:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\frac{v}{4}\\right)^2\\left(\\frac{3}{u}\\right)^2 &= \\frac{4}{3}\\cdot\\frac{v^2}{16}\\cdot\\frac{9}{u^2} \\\\ &= \\frac{36v^2}{48u^2} \\\\ &= \\frac{3v^2}{4u^2}\\end{aligned}\n$$"
    },
