      ":question/id": "ecaddecb-a518-5240-bd54-3119aa4e584a",
      ":question/problem": "What is $(\\frac{2x}{3})^{2}(\\frac{3}{x})^{3}$?",
      ":question/worked-solution": "First, we apply the power of quotient rule and the power of product rule:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\left(\\frac{2x}{3}\\right)^2\\left(\\frac{3}{x}\\right)^3 &= \\frac{4x^2}{9}\\cdot\\frac{27}{x^3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we multiply, apply the quotient rule and simplify:\n\n$$\n\\frac{108x^2}{9x^3}=\\frac{12}{x}\n$$"
    },
